00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.700
I don't have the energy today.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.830
Riri's been lonely.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:17.750
What?

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:21.330
It's her birthday, but you've been gone all day.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:25.330
Plus, she failed to fill the
openings in her legion again.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:29.200
Oh, but I bet you were out
hunting for ramune, right?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.700
How did you...?

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:37.120
Is there any other reason you'd
leave your Schild alone on her birthday?

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.410
No, I suppose not.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.500
Right?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.160
Now, hurry up and give her your present!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.120
I see.

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.330
You've had a tough day, huh?

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.660
But you did a good thing, right?

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:52.700
I don't really regret it.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.040
Well, sometimes you just get unlucky.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:04.410
That's...

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:05.660
What's up?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.120
Those are...

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.830
It's in power-saving mode!

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.910
Ramune.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.830
Oh, Yuyu!

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:35.040
Oh-ho. So, this is the ramune
I've heard so much about.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.950
You did this for me, Yuyu?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.330
What do you think, Riri?

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.790
I'm so happy!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.370
This is ramune from the vending
machine by the main gate, right?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.790
I figured she'd know.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.580
Yes, I suppose she would.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.660
I go to buy it all the time on my days off.

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.330
You must have known about that, right?

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.330
It doesn't look that way to me.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:18:00.330
In the end... this proves that
I'm not as impressive as you think I am.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.830
What? No way!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:05.000
You're a great big sister to me, Miss Yuyu!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.700
Absolutely not.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:11.200
I don't believe that I could do
anything to make you so happy.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.870
You can! You totally can!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.000
S-So,

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.910
can I have one more thing?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.500
All right.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.330
I...

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:22.620
I want you, Yuyu!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.450
What?!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.410
That's extreme, Riri!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.250
Help yourself.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.620
I will!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:41.700
I'm all sweaty, you know.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.500
You smell like a vineyard.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.290
I knew it.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:50.250
It's always you who gives me things.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.660
Y-Yuyu?

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:57.950
Riri... happy birthday.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.660
You two are being indecent!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.750
E-E-Extra!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.540
Huh?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.040
Yuyu,

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.160
I-I'm really happy, but, umm...

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.370
Th-That hurts.

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:13.000
What a passionate hug!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.080
Yuyu...

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.950
What should I do?

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.620
That's what I'd like to know.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:21.160
I get that Miss Yuyu isn't used to giving hugs,

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:24.450
but show some resistance, Riri!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.000
Riri?!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.910
You seem to be having fun, Mai.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:37.160
How could I not be after you
showed me something so funny?

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.950
This is

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.830
all I can do.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.620
Th-That's not true, Yuyu.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.500
Tazusa and I decided earlier.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:52.790
I know we took our time,
but let us join your legion, Riri.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.160
Sorry we're "eccentric."

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:59.620
Umm, I told you, it's Yuyu's
legion, not mine, and... Huh?

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:02.620
D-Does that mean we've got nine people?!

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:04.370
A full legion?!

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.080
Oh my, what a pleasant surprise.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:08.620
Congratulations, Riri.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.950
What a boisterous day it's been.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:17.750
I love everyone, but Yuyu giving her all
for you made me love her even more!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.580
Riri!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.790
Y-Yes?

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:24.120
Well, think of us as a present
from Yuyu to you today.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.500
Don't be shy; take us.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:29.450
Miss Mai, Tazusa...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.040
I'm so glad to have you!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.290
I guess this means it was
worth working up a sweat.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.040
Yes, but how long do you two
plan to cling to each other?!

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:45.410
I look forward to working with you, Tazusa.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.540
You're adorable.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:49.830
So, even Shenlin looks like that sometimes.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.750
She's like my family's cat.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:56.910
How cute.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:00.290
Riri was really happy today, wasn't she?

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:02.370
Yes, well...

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.040
Were you watching?

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:05.290
Of course not.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.500
But if I put myself in her place, I can tell.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.750
If the big sister she adores
gives her a present,

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:16.370
would she really care if it
were something she wanted or not?

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.000
Oh, yes,

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.660
I do know that Riri has a full
nine people for her legion.

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.290
You have sharp ears, as usual.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.540
Don't mention it.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:32.830
I don't want to admit it, but it's a miracle.

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:36.620
Are you finally ready to acknowledge Riri?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:39.080
I'm... not sure.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:43.410
She's reckless, and I never
know what she'll do next.

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.790
Does that excite you?

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.660
What are you talking about?

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:52.080
Making <i>the </i>Yuyu act so adorable is quite a feat.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.700
The Rare Skill, "Charisma."

00:21:54.700 --> 00:22:00.410
A support and control Skill that
manifests exceptional leadership.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.160
Riri's Rare Skill?

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:03.160
It can't be.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.870
It's still under investigation.

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:07.700
But she made a Schutzengel pledge

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:11.870
with a lone wolf like you
and drew you into her legion.

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:14.410
That's a miracle on its own.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:17.580
You're saying that I'm
in the palm of Riri's hand?

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.540
I don't know about that.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:27.330
It's not... a pleasant thought.

